    <item>
      <title>已成功注册talkatone经验分享</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2260118</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2260118</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 04:59:57 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;纯经验分享：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;我是用苹果手机 + 美区 Apple ID 安装 Talkatone，将代理切换到日本家宽后，打开软件并使用谷歌邮箱注册，成功率比较高。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;注册完成后，你就能获得一个美国手机号。这个号码即使不充值，也可以通过每月发送一条短信的方式长期保号，基本算是 0 成本维护。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;实测下来，WhatsApp 无需充值即可接收短信验证码并完成注册。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;如果是用于接收 OpenAI 的短信验证码，可以先开通 1.99 美元/月的 Light 会员完成验证，后续不用的话也可以停止续费，整体成本相对较低。&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/f/e/4/fe4c3623f2ad9bdba24eeed8c87369bf99772854.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/AhCyI3SVWlRuOLPLGyAIBPsJuni.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/e/4/fe4c3623f2ad9bdba24eeed8c87369bf99772854_2_261x500.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;AhCyI3SVWlRuOLPLGyAIBPsJuni&quot; width=&quot;261&quot; height=&quot;500&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/e/4/fe4c3623f2ad9bdba24eeed8c87369bf99772854_2_261x500.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/e/4/fe4c3623f2ad9bdba24eeed8c87369bf99772854_2_391x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/e/4/fe4c3623f2ad9bdba24eeed8c87369bf99772854_2_522x1000.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;DBE4EF&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/9/f/e/9fe11a96b103813af70ca648c5ed711171342524.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/mOmcr6SA4GUpcwak5WusAyKDN88.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/9/f/e/9fe11a96b103813af70ca648c5ed711171342524_2_242x499.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;mOmcr6SA4GUpcwak5WusAyKDN88&quot; width=&quot;242&quot; height=&quot;499&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/9/f/e/9fe11a96b103813af70ca648c5ed711171342524_2_242x499.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/9/f/e/9fe11a96b103813af70ca648c5ed711171342524_2_363x748.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/9/f/e/9fe11a96b103813af70ca648c5ed711171342524_2_484x998.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;DDE2E8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;APP购买talkatone light会员：&lt;br&gt;
可以使用支付宝，将定位切换到美国，浏览器打开&lt;a href=&quot;https://ur.alipay.com/_6UQdzN8yUtEMBMywY4dArY&quot; class=&quot;inline-onebox&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;支付宝&lt;/a&gt; ，可以切换到支付宝Pockyt Shop,登录后选择APP Store&amp; iTunes USA 购买，2美元即可。然后切换到你的app store兑换礼品卡。&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/d/5/7/d57f3ef247231fc060e8d6b6d3aa58d327279e98.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/usGk6rbppInXEEhg9jhjARAdfzG.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/d/5/7/d57f3ef247231fc060e8d6b6d3aa58d327279e98_2_239x500.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;usGk6rbppInXEEhg9jhjARAdfzG&quot; width=&quot;239&quot; height=&quot;500&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/d/5/7/d57f3ef247231fc060e8d6b6d3aa58d327279e98_2_239x500.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/d/5/7/d57f3ef247231fc060e8d6b6d3aa58d327279e98_2_358x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/d/5/7/d57f3ef247231fc060e8d6b6d3aa58d327279e98_2_478x1000.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;C7CED9&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/0/f/7/0f7da36a17a5bf7baa8e6244475aff4f9a138b65.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/2d2l8CMJsvu8jbbkHGIdiHoicvz.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/f/7/0f7da36a17a5bf7baa8e6244475aff4f9a138b65_2_293x500.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;2d2l8CMJsvu8jbbkHGIdiHoicvz&quot; width=&quot;293&quot; height=&quot;500&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/f/7/0f7da36a17a5bf7baa8e6244475aff4f9a138b65_2_293x500.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/f/7/0f7da36a17a5bf7baa8e6244475aff4f9a138b65_2_439x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/f/7/0f7da36a17a5bf7baa8e6244475aff4f9a138b65_2_586x1000.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;E0E7ED&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;
